Output "assets/demo.gif"

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 860
Set Height 500
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Hyper"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set BorderRadius 8
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "./bin/forge list"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2400ms

Type "./bin/forge doctor"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3200ms
